# T3 / server conventions

- Env schema lives in `src/env.js`. Optional vars stay optional until the feature needs them (`DATABASE_URL`, `AUTH_SECRET`).
- `db` may be `null` — always guard before queries. Public site must build without Postgres.
- New API surface = tRPC router procedure, not ad-hoc REST, unless NextAuth/webhook requires a route.
- Validate inputs with Zod at the procedure door.
- Auth adapter only when `db` exists; skip `auth()` when `AUTH_SECRET` is missing.
- Drizzle schema: `src/server/db/schema.ts`. Migrations via drizzle-kit only when `DATABASE_URL` is set.
- Client calls go through `api` from `src/trpc/react` — don't fetch `/api/trpc` by hand from components.
